      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11206818::web::028::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain refinement and Laves-phase strengthening will inhibit dislocation motion and crack propagation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11206818::web::028::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The graded Ti-Mo-Nb-Ta coating will nearly double surface hardness relative to untreated TC4.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11206818::web::028::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will reduce the friction coefficient relative to untreated TC4 under high-contact-stress conditions.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimized coating will exhibit robust adhesion without cracks or delamination.",
